silm:instances_papers_18_presheaf_semantics_03_olog_node_arrow_law_yoneda_hom_leg_5_P_hasMass silm:hasExample "In 'P1803_olog_node_arrow_lawYonedaHomLeg5', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, contravariant action P(hasBodyMass): P(BodyMassQuality) -> P(DomesticCat) recovering the bearer of Mittens' mass" .
